>You </span><span begin="01:24.090" end="01:24.450">know </span><span begin="01:24.450" end="01:24.780">we're </span><span begin="01:24.780" end="01:25.710">friends </span><span begin="01:25.710" end="01:26.160">till </span><span begin="01:26.160" end="01:26.460">we </span><span begin="01:26.460" end="01:28.320">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.580" end="01:32.700"><span begin="01:29.580" end="01:29.790">And </span><span begin="01:29.790" end="01:30.150">either </span><span begin="01:30.150" end="01:30.660">way </span><span begin="01:30.660" end="01:30.810">you </span><span begin="01:30.810" end="01:32.700">turn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.940" end="01:36.120"><span begin="01:32.940" end="01:33.480">I'll </span><span begin="01:33.480" end="01:34.200">be </span><span begin="01:34.200" end="01:36.120">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.180" end="01:39.090"><span begin="01:36.180" end="01:36.720">Open </span><span begin="01:36.720" end="01:37.050">up </span><span begin="01:37.050" end="01:37.230">your </span><span begin="01:37.230" end="01:39.090">skull</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.390" end="01:41.220"><span begin="01:39.390" end="01:39.900">I'll </span><span begin="01:39.900" end="01:40.680">be </span><span begin="01:40.680" end="01:41.220">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.220" end="01:42.630"><span begin="01:41.220" end="01:41.572">Climbing </span><span begin="01:41.572" end="01:41.924">up </span><span begin="01:41.924" end="01:42.276">the </span><span begin="01:42.276" end="01:42.630">walls</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.950" end="01:59.730"><span begin="01:55.950" end="01:56.520">It's </span><span begin="01:56.520" end="01:57.210">always </span><span begin="01:57.210" end="01:58.050">best </span><span begin="01:58.050" end="01:58.440">when </span><span begin="01:58.440" end="01:58.620">the </span><span begin="01:58.620" end="01:59.310">light </span><span begin="01:59.310" end="01:59.670">is </